                  Parameters for LUSIM
                  ********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
nscore.dat                       \file with data
1   2   0    5                   \   columns for X,Y,Z, normal scores
-1.0e21    1.0e21                \   trimming limits
3                                \debugging level: 0,1,2,3
lusim.dbg                        \file for debugging output
lusim.out                        \file for realization(s)
1                                \number of realizations
10   0.5   5.0                   \nx,xmn,xsiz
10   0.5   5.0                   \ny,ymn,ysiz
1    0.5   1.0                   \nz,zmn,zsiz
69069                            \random number seed
1    0.2                         \nst, nugget effect
1    0.8  0.0   0.0   0.0        \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         10.0  10.0  10.0        \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
